%% Same node/edge contract as decision-flow.svg.
flowchart TD
    CONTRACT["1. Select D (domain/profile) and check the B (input) contract<br/>Laboratory Observation: code + name + value/statistics + unit + reference context<br/>Malformed input fails; preserve every reference interval and its qualifiers"]
    VALIDATION["2. Formal validation requested?<br/>Full FHIR file or CSV resource_json → local Matchbox/HL7 + pinned guide<br/>Scalar sets → not_applicable; unavailable/invalid validation remains explicit"]
    LOOKUP["3. Verify the declared code/system and unit/system using configured sources<br/>Local first → enabled APIs for the exact system; retain every attempt and edition<br/>LOINC component, property, specimen/system, timing, scale and method"]
    INVALID["Confirmed invalid<br/>Record deterministic error<br/>Continue other independent checks"]
    VERIFIED["Verified identity / syntax<br/>Check code-unit-context fit<br/>Membership alone is insufficient"]
    UNKNOWN["Unverified / unavailable<br/>Keep evidence gap visible<br/>Do not call absence invalid"]
    FIT["4. Assess unit fit and transformation<br/>Documented code–unit fit; verified conversion → factor for values and bounds<br/>Positive linear factor also scales mean, sample SD, minimum and maximum<br/>Missing evidence or ambiguous count denominator → expert review, no forced map"]
    NUMERIC["5. Check quantities and context; write the checked CSV<br/>Numeric values, supplied sample statistics, units, specimen/method and reference bounds<br/>Observed extremes and mean ± SD do not define a reference interval"]
    NO_AI["A1: laboratory check<br/>Deterministic findings + sources<br/>Optional full FHIR outcome<br/>No model calls"]
    AI["A2: lab · scope=lookup<br/>Local AI suggests code/name/unit<br/>Real candidate retrieval + recheck<br/>No literature retrieval"]
    EVIDENCE["A3: lab · scope=studies<br/>Same AI + configured study APIs<br/>Quote statistics / units / intervals<br/>Keep gaps and failures visible"]
    REVIEW["6. Review the whole proposal with its evidence<br/>Original set → linked code/analyte/name/units → proposal with transformations<br/>Physician records decision, reviewer, time and rationale; source remains unchanged<br/>Numeric readiness, FHIR conformance and clinical correctness stay distinct"]
    REUSE["7. Optional laboratory mapping reuse<br/>Import clinician decisions; recheck target code, unit, factor and reference bounds<br/>Source, catalogue, profile or context changes require renewed review<br/>Apply approved transformations in institutional ETL and validate the resulting FHIR<br/>No automated resource rewrite or model retraining"]
    CONTRACT --> VALIDATION
    VALIDATION --> LOOKUP
    LOOKUP --> INVALID
    LOOKUP --> VERIFIED
    LOOKUP --> UNKNOWN
    INVALID --> FIT
    VERIFIED --> FIT
    UNKNOWN --> FIT
    FIT --> NUMERIC
    NUMERIC --> NO_AI
    NUMERIC -.-> |"explicit second pass"| AI
    NUMERIC -.-> |"explicit second pass"| EVIDENCE
    NO_AI --> REVIEW
    AI --> REVIEW
    EVIDENCE --> REVIEW
    REVIEW --> REUSE
    classDef normal fill:#f3f7fa,stroke:#c4d5df,color:#142d42
    class CONTRACT,VALIDATION,LOOKUP,UNKNOWN,FIT,NO_AI,REVIEW normal
    classDef teal fill:#eef7f4,stroke:#a8cfc6,color:#142d42
    class VERIFIED,NUMERIC,AI,EVIDENCE,REUSE teal
    classDef error fill:#fcf1f3,stroke:#ecc7cf,color:#142d42
    class INVALID error
